        "content": "<p>Benjins opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/15362\">issue #15362</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<h3><code>.clif</code> Test Case</h3>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">test</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">run</span>\n<span class=\"n\">set</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">regalloc_algorithm</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">single_pass</span>\n<span class=\"n\">set</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">enable_multi_ret_implicit_sret</span>\n<span class=\"n\">target</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x86_64</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">function</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">%</span><span class=\"n\">callee</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"n\">block0</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nc\">v0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">iconst</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1000</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">v1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">iconst</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1001</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">v2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">iconst</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1002</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">v3</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">iconst</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1003</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">v4</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">iconst</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1004</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">v5</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">iconst</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1005</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">v6</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">iconst</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1006</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">v7</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">iconst</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1007</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">v8</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">iconst</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1008</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v6</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v7</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v8</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">function</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">%</span><span class=\"n\">caller</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">sig0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">fn0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">%</span><span class=\"n\">callee</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span>\n<span class=\"n\">block0</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nc\">try_call</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fn0</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sig0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">block1</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ret8</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ret8</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[]</span>\n<span class=\"n\">block1</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">v1</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v2</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nc\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v2</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">%</span><span class=\"n\">caller</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1008</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3>Steps to Reproduce</h3>\n<p>Run the test case with <code>cargo run -p cranelift-tools --bin clif-util -- test &lt;path&gt;</code></p>\n<h3>Expected Results</h3>\n<p>The test should pass: . It does pass with:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">block1</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">v1</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v2</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nc\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v1</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>even though <code>v1</code> and <code>v2</code> are given the same value from <code>callee</code>. It also passes without the <code>set regalloc_algorithm=single_pass</code> line.</p>\n<h3>Actual Results</h3>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">2026</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">11</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">18</span><span class=\"n\">T23</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">46</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">46</span><span class=\"n\">Z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ERROR</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cranelift_filetests</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">concurrent</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FAIL</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">run</span>\n<span class=\"n\">FAIL</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bug_01</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">clif</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">run</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">Caused</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">by</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nc\">Failed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">test</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">run</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">%</span><span class=\"n\">caller</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1008</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">actual</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">134149612526944</span>\n<span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tests</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Error</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">failure</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>The actual value varies, it seems like a garbage read from something. Here's a subset of the disassembly for <code>caller</code>:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"GAS\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"err\">21:</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"err\">41</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">ff</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"no\">d7</span><span class=\"w\">                </span><span class=\"no\">callq</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"p\">*</span><span class=\"nv\">%r15</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"err\">24:</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"err\">4</span><span class=\"nf\">c</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"no\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"no\">c</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">24</span><span class=\"w\">             </span><span class=\"no\">movq</span><span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">%rsp</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">%r11</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"err\">28:</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"err\">4</span><span class=\"nf\">c</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">89</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"no\">c</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">24</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">48</span><span class=\"w\">          </span><span class=\"no\">movq</span><span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nv\">%r11</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0x48</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">%rsp</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"err\">2</span><span class=\"nl\">d:</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"err\">4</span><span class=\"nf\">c</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"no\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"no\">c</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">24</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">08</span><span class=\"w\">          </span><span class=\"no\">movq</span><span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">%rsp</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">%r11</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"c1\">; ... (nothing writes to 0x40(%rsp) but it's then read)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"err\">69:</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"err\">48</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"err\">8</span><span class=\"nf\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">44</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">24</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">40</span><span class=\"w\">          </span><span class=\"no\">movq</span><span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"mi\">0x40</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">%rsp</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">%rax</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3>Versions and Environment</h3>\n<p>Cranelift version or commit: 3ce2209872ccf1ea115914a81e020aef66a10c51, latest trunk</p>\n<p>Operating system: Ubuntu 24.04.3 LTS</p>\n<p>Architecture: X86-64</p>\n<h3>Extra Info</h3>\n<p>This was found by a fuzzer created with LLM assistance, however I have manually verified the repro case and written the report here. I'm a lot less familiar w/ Cranelift than LLVM, so apologies if this is an unsupported configuration (it is a pretty niche situation)<br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>",
