    {
        "content": "<p>cfallin <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/15362#issuecomment-7015799314\">commented</a> on <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/15362\">issue #15362</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Thanks! FWIW, the single-pass regalloc is not tier-1 supported, and historically has had several bugs that have required us to disable it at various points. I don't know if anyone here has the bandwidth to look into this at the moment (I don't, at least). Perhaps we should disable it again (cc @fitzgen @alexcrichton for thoughts though)...</p>\n</blockquote>",
