        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1795106997
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>alexcrichton <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/15362#issuecomment-7018130774\">commented</a> on <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/15362\">issue #15362</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>If this affects wasm, then I think it'd be ok to turn it off, but if this is CLIF-only then I think it'd be reasonable to leave it available for wasm use still. We've got a good number of CLIF-only bugs which I don't think are too too worrisome</p>\n</blockquote>",
